# Line-ending and binary handling for mobile/.
#
# NOTE: .gitattributes CANNOT pin a file mode. The executable bit on
# mobile/android/gradlew lives in the git index (100755) and has to be set with
#   git update-index --chmod=+x mobile/android/gradlew
# by whoever regenerates the project on Windows, where core.filemode=false makes
# new files land as 100644. See docs/phase4/adr-p4-03-mobile-tech-stack.md §8.1.
#
# What this file does control: gradlew must stay LF (a CRLF shebang breaks the
# script on Linux/macOS), and the wrapper jar must never be treated as text.

mobile/android/gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

mobile/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar binary
